"description": "S.P.E.E.H. Hidroelectrica SA produces and distributes hydroelectric power. It engages in generation and operation, supply, development, and maintenance services. The firm also provides water management services from own accumulations by supplying raw water, debit adjustments, floods protection, debit insurance and other common water management services. The company was founded in 1990 and is headquartered in Bucharest, Romania.",
